WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,520
I heard that the other party left the imperial capital after losing to me.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,040
Lost into a certain sect

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:06,120
The eldest son of the Prime Minister's Mansion

4
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,360
He should have lost to me

5
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,520
That’s why you choose to be a student of the Corpse Corpse.

6
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:12,220
I didn’t expect that the grievances at that time could not be resolved.

7
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,820
Now there is another grudge

8
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:19,890
If you can get your household registration back

9
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,090
first thing

10
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,920
I still want to go back to Uncle Anyuan's Mansion to see

11
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:31,650
if there is a chance

12
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,100
I also want to give it to someone I’ve only met once.

13
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,020
Princess Mingyue apologizes

14
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:45,750
After all, I was the cause of this matter from beginning to end.

15
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,670
I saw Tamburo's team.

16
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:54,270
It should be that great prince Liu Shi

17
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:55,750
Would you say this is healing?

18
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:58,510
Just take a woman who has lost her innocence

19
00:00:58,870 --> 00:01:00,190
Why do you need to make it so grand?
